  "label": "Child Bride Stereotype",
  "description": "The meme uses the stereotype that in some Muslim-majority cultures, girls are sold or forced into early marriage, often as child brides, which is portrayed as a form of sexual slavery. This stereotype is used to frame the image as evidence of systemic oppression, even though the image does not provide evidence of the girl's age, the nature of the transaction, or the cultural context.",
